/* cuopus phase 2: single-translation-unit include of the DEVICE-macro-ported
 * libopus 1.5.2 SILK decode path (device/gen/**, regenerated by
 * device/port_silk.py — do not edit gen/ by hand, edit the port script).
 *
 * Single TU avoids -rdc device linking of __device__ tables and lets nvcc
 * inline across the whole decode call graph. Include order: entropy decoder
 * first (silk needs ec_dec), then tables, then the decode code.
 */
